    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the edge of time, trying to save the last crumbs of humanity, fighting dark creatures that are puppeteered by an even darker force. You, the Paragon of Time, are an ancient hero that has now awaken to complete your mission: Vanquish the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/ab7a18e9e443054c5b1d3edbd4d59ae0.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Paragon Of Time</i></strong> is a rogue-lite adventure game where you collect powerful upgrades and forge new weapons to strengthen your character. <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/09c64b8e8d73c1270b7946c07390b001.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight your way through, you\u2019ll destroy enemies to claim mighty artefacts, and use them to enhance your abilities and weapons. This way, you can make unique builds that suit your playstyle, making most playthroughs unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/3579621dbf3f89291222eaf4c7ff3010.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each played round, you will be able to permanently improve your character by purchasing upgrades using the souls of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/63e9d997fb2ed28ed21a66cf8368c3d7.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to overcome the final challenge\u2014the all-consuming malice that enshrouds the earth\u2014and bring an end to its corruption.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stand at the edge of time, trying to save the last crumbs of humanity, fighting dark creatures that are puppeteered by an even darker force. You, the Paragon of Time, are an ancient hero that has now awaken to complete your mission: Vanquish the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/ab7a18e9e443054c5b1d3edbd4d59ae0.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Paragon Of Time</i></strong> is a rogue-lite adventure game where you collect powerful upgrades and forge new weapons to strengthen your character. <br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/09c64b8e8d73c1270b7946c07390b001.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight your way through, you\u2019ll destroy enemies to claim mighty artefacts, and use them to enhance your abilities and weapons. This way, you can make unique builds that suit your playstyle, making most playthroughs unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/3579621dbf3f89291222eaf4c7ff3010.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each played round, you will be able to permanently improve your character by purchasing upgrades using the souls of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600970/extras/63e9d997fb2ed28ed21a66cf8368c3d7.avif?t=1746954074\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to overcome the final challenge\u2014the all-consuming malice that enshrouds the earth\u2014and bring an end to its corruption.</p>",
